; Write pointer of the redraw run list
;
; Word. #R$97B7 sets it to $C200, the start of the redraw run list, at the beginning of the redraw pass of each frame;
; #R$9719 advances it as it appends the records of the runs of marked cells of a row and keeps a $FF after the last
; record. #R$95FF later walks the list and draws the cells.
@label=RedrawListPtr
g$855D DEFW $0000
